e added to the hangman game on the blackboard. Failure to destroy all objects results in being unable to advance to the exit door. Completing the game requires all hangman letters to be completed and the player to reach the main door.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849050/extras/b7afdedf8c4f843380531615beacf528.poster.avif?t=1727614420\" width=736 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849050/extras/b7afdedf8c4f843380531615beacf528.webm?t=1727614420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849050/extras/b7afdedf8c4f843380531615beacf528.mp4?t=1727614420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849050/extras/c50738f47ccd792f808b1210ceca8043.avif?t=1727614420\" width=800 height=64 /></span><br>If all of the hangman's limbs are completed due to the player's mistakes in advancing to the exit, the hangman game will reset, restarting the puppets and words, and the player will need to start over. Destroying objects without anomalies will result in the puppet being added a limb to the gibbet on the blackboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849050/extras/7863b6f5438faf8711d3b316167053b5.poster.avif?t=1727614420\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849050/extras/7863b6f5438faf8711d3b316167053b5.webm?t=1727614420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849050/extras/7863b6f5438faf8711d3b316167053b5.mp4?t=17276144